## Two-Stage Classification + Briefing

```
Domain + Objective
       ↓
┌──────────────────────────────────────┐
│ STAGE 1: Project Classification      │
│                                      │
│ • Analyze domain name                │
│ • Parse objective                    │
│ • Maybe check existing site          │
│ • Determine site_type                │
│ • Recommend group                    │
│                                      │
│ Output: site_type, recommended_group │
└──────────────────────────────────────┘
       ↓
[HITL 1: Confirm site type + group selection]
       ↓
┌──────────────────────────────────────┐
│ STAGE 2: Group-Specific Briefing     │
│                                      │
│ • Detailed questions for this type   │
│ • Landing: CTAs, value prop, urgency │
│ • Content: categories, tone, ad strategy │
│                                      │
│ Output: structured_brief             │
└──────────────────────────────────────┘
       ↓
[HITL 2: Review brief, add info]
       ↓
Execute chosen group workflow
