## Versioning Model

**Group versions are immutable snapshots:**

```sql
agent_group_definitions:
  id: uuid
  group_type: "landing-page-builder"
  version: 3
  agent_configs: [...]  -- includes agent_type + optional version/image_tag
  orchestration_workflow: {...}
  briefing_questionnaire: {...}
  created_at: timestamp

-- v1, v2 still exist as separate rows
-- New sites get latest version (or specific if requested)
-- Existing sites reference specific version
```

**Site manifest records what built it:**

```sql
site_manifest:
  id: uuid
  domain: "boxing-tickets.com"
  group_type: "landing-page-builder"
  group_version: 2  -- Pinned to the version that built it
  brief_data: {...}
  build_plan: {...}
  last_built: timestamp

-- Rebuild uses same group_version unless explicitly upgraded
```

**Agent pinning within groups:**

```json
{
  "agent_configs": [
    {"role": "strategist", "agent_type": "chief-strategist"},  -- uses current
    {"role": "architect", "agent_type": "landing-architect", "image_tag": "v1.0.450"}  -- pinned
  ]
}
```

Groups can pin specific agent versions where stability matters, or float to current where improvements are wanted.

